Package: cinnade-desktop-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Common files for Cinnade desktop apps
 This package includes files that are shared between several Cinnade
 apps (i18n files and configuration schemas).

