Package: libcvc0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Cinnade pulseaudio abstraction library
 This library contains code to access PulseAudio using a GObject
 based library, shared between cinnade-control-center, cinnade-settings-daemon
 and cinnade. It is not API stable, and it is meant to be used
 as a submodule.
